</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>How deep the holy joy that fills that scene,</l><l>Where love is known!</l><l>Thy love, our God and Father, now is seen,</l><l>In Him alone;</l><l>As, in the holy calm of Thine own rest,</l><l>He leads the praise of those Thy love has blessed.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>He leads the praise! How precious to Thine ear</l><l>The song He sings!</l><l>How precious, too, to Thee—how near, how dear</l><l>Are those He brings</l><l>To share His place: ’twas thus that Thou didst plan;</l><l>Thou lovedst Him before the world began.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
